11. PRICE ALIASING - no px_legal, nothing rejects a bad price
====================================================================================================
order table : 4 x 16 = 64 slots, slot 132 bits
level table : 2 sides x 16384 slots, 14 addr bits, 10280 reachable via px_index
level source: shadow of the write bus
book id     : 85603   in scope: A U E D   dropped: F C
50000 on-tick  -> index 5280
50005 off-tick -> index 5280  (same index, quantities merge)
100000 over cap -> index 0  (level 0, a real level at price 0)
negative      -> index 0 as well, via unsigned reinterpretation
this harness checks nothing - read the dumps
